he tutorial\n  content owners.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): tutorial packaging format defined so tutorials are versioned\n  and testable independently of Dashboard releases. This epic's priority is\n  P0 by inheritance: the format transitively enables the P0 gallery and P0\n  curated-tutorial requirements, and an epic blocking all P0 work is\n  implicitly P0.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37697,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-903b1fe713702bfa","agent_id":"aba7fb9fdd72707ee","session_id":"a9cf95da-4842-4821-bfce-05c3c9153e25","uuid":"f52ae5f7-f562-40b7-86b6-1f75556a0ef2","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:06:46.074Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9019"}
